      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260903/202609032329333354.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260903/202609032329333354_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260903/202609032329333354_720.jpg"> </div><p>【马丁内利加盟新月】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-04/6a99920c6fed3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">枪手卖人新纪录！官方：马丁内利转会利雅得新月，转会费7000万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260904/202609040035389836_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260904/202609040035389836_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260904/202609040035389836_720.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，阿森纳前锋马丁内利加盟沙特联球队利雅得新月，结束长达7年的枪手生涯。马丁内利与新月签约四年。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-04/6a99a4b73d8e9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">壕！瓦利德亲王全额承担马丁内利、沃特金斯转会费、本泽马解约金</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260203/202602030926252177_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260203/202602030926252177_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260203/202602030926252177_720.jpg"> </div><p>利雅得新月公告确认，瓦利德亲王全额资助了马丁内利转会至利雅得新月的交易。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-04/6a99a202701efnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">永远是枪手！阿森纳官方：马丁内利加盟新月，祝他未来一切顺利</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.77" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260904/202609040036418977.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.77" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.77" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260904/202609040036418977.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260904/202609040036418977.jpg"> </div><p>阿森纳官方确认，马丁内利加盟利雅得新月，俱乐部在公告中向这名前锋表达了祝福。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-04/6a99aa0a26e12native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">马丁内利告别信：曾以为我会永远在这里，感谢一切！含泪写下告别</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.3" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260904/202609040111188048_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.3" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.3" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260904/202609040111188048_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260904/202609040111188048_720.jpg"> </div><p>马丁内利加盟新月交易已经官宣。马丁内利本人在社媒发布长文，向枪迷告别。全文如下。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-04/6a99b040e176anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">毕竟无奈离队！马丁内利告别信详细感谢所有人，但未提阿尔特塔</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251002/68dd9d312b601.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251002/68dd9d312b601.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251002/68dd9d312b601.jpg"> </div><p>马丁内利在社媒发布了一篇情真意切的告别信。其中，马丁内利详细感谢了各个领域的所有人，但并没有明确提到主教练阿尔特塔。</p><p>【其他新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-04/6a999e98d038cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">这事没完！记者：巴萨冬窗仍全力追小蜘蛛，这已是个人恩怨问题</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260824/6a8ba459df6ff_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260824/6a8ba459df6ff.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260824/6a8ba459df6ff.jpg"> </div><p>每日体育报报道，记者David Bernabeu表示，巴萨在冬季转会窗会全力追逐阿尔瓦雷斯，这桩转会大戏远远没完。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-04/6a99a3fa1a0fbnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">C罗卫冕压力山大！新月组1.9亿欧英超三叉戟：马丁内利领衔锋线</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.34" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260904/202609040228053512_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.34" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.34" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260904/202609040228053512_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260904/202609040228053512_720.jpg"> </div><p>新月今夏7000万欧签下马丁内利，6450万欧签下萨默维尔，5840万欧签下沃特金斯，总支出1亿9290万欧。胜利与C罗，本赛季卫冕面临巨大压力。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-04/6a99cd9a217cbnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">努涅斯：在新月最后6个月极其难熬，绝不希望任何人有我如此遭遇</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260204/6982b45e096c5.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260204/6982b45e096c5.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260204/6982b45e096c5.jpg"> </div><p>乌拉圭前锋努涅斯回顾了新月生涯，这段沙特之旅显然给他留下了极其糟糕的印象，他直言，绝不希望任何人有他那样的经历。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-04/6a999a138a33bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">孤注一掷！专家：无欧战+3.2亿引援+薪资暴涨 热刺或触犯财政规则</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260830/6a93f33f276db_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260830/6a93f33f276db_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260830/6a93f33f276db_720.jpg"> </div><p>进球网报道，足球财政问题专家斯特凡·博尔森表示，热刺夏窗豪掷3.2英镑引援，可能触犯欧足联财政规则。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-04/6a99b3260e1d9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">巴萨官方：会员大会将于9月19日举行，上赛季营收破10亿欧创纪录</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260109/696103d091aae.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260109/696103d091aae.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260109/696103d091aae.jpg"> </div><p>巴萨俱乐部官方的消息，巴萨俱乐部董事会于2026年9月3日召开例行会议，并批准召开普通会员大会。同时公告确认，俱乐部上赛季营收破纪录。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-04/6a99c5b81c436native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">FIFA指控欧足联：针对因凡蒂诺发起诽谤运动 阻止小国财力增长</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260801/6a6ddbb70a8a4_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260801/6a6ddbb70a8a4_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260801/6a6ddbb70a8a4_720.jpg"> </div><p>天空体育报道，国际足球对欧足联的诉讼做出回应，指控其针对因凡蒂诺发起“诽谤运动”。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-04/6a99eae4d471cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">法尔克：曼城曾想1亿欧报价帕夫洛维奇但球员不想走 因此签布阿迪</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240310/65ed03e195fd5.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240310/65ed03e195fd5.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240310/65ed03e195fd5.jpg"> </div><p>记者法尔克消息，夏窗期间曼城曾询问过拜仁球员帕夫洛维奇的转会意愿，曼城方面甚至愿意给出高达1亿欧的报价签人。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-04/6a99d2ccc41dbnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">电讯报：图赫尔接受世界杯复盘调查，尤其是半决赛不敌阿根廷</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.4" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a57fe58dbe65_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.4" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.4" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a57fe58dbe65_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a57fe58dbe65_720.jpg"> </div><p>英媒电讯报独家消息，图赫尔已接受世界杯复盘调查，英足总报告将包含对半决赛战术、大名单遴选，甚至大本营选址的相关结论。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-04/6a999cd695278native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">传播色情视频案结束，阿森西奥发文：无罪！一直相信正义终将伸张</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.25" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260904/202609040014597238.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.25" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.25" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260904/202609040014597238.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260904/202609040014597238.jpg"> </div><p>皇马中卫劳尔·阿森西奥传播未成年人色情视频案结束，根据此前消息，阿森西奥赔偿受害者并出庭当面道歉获得了谅解，检方最终撤诉。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-04/6a99d95623408native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：曼城曾1.5亿欧报价小蜘蛛但没得到球员回应 最后迅速签恩佐</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260824/6a8ba44a9b917_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260824/6a8ba44a9b917_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260824/6a8ba44a9b917_720.jpg"> </div><p>记者罗伯托·戈麦斯透露，曼城关窗前曾1.5亿欧报价阿尔瓦雷斯，遭拒后签下恩佐。</p><a href="http://m.zhibo8.cc/topic/index.html?id=165" class="hide" style="     background: url('http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_200905/zt_4221599266620.png') no-repeat;     background-size: cover;     display: block;     height: 150px;     max-width: 690px;     color: white;     margin: 24px auto;     position: re